Error [E0057]: `take` is now the `^` sigil
  --> tests/ui/cap_take_keyword.jet:3:12
    |
  3 | fn archive(take name: String) -> String {
    |            ^^^^
 Why: capability is written with a sigil on the type, not a word — so all code reads the same
 Fix: write `^` in place of `take`

